f=\"https://apd013.itch.io/northbound/devlog\"><svg aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4642410/northbound\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">NORTHBOUND</h1></div><div id=\"view_html_game_7040505\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_8098442\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div data-height=\"560\" data-width=\"1280\" style=\"width: 1280px; height: 560px\" class=\"game_frame game_pending\"><button title=\"Enter fullscreen\" class=\"fullscreen_btn\"><img src=\"https://itch.io/static/images/enlarge.svg?1788406861\"/></button><div class=\"iframe_placeholder\" data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/18040968/index.html?v=1782544990&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg aria-hidden width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"donate\"><a href=\"https://apd013.itch.io/northbound/donate\" class=\"button donate_btn\" data-donate=\"true\">Support This Game</a></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><strong></strong><strong>Eight souls land on a strange shore. None of them will be the same when spring comes &mdash; if it comes.</strong></p>\r\n<p>NORTHBOUND is a Viking settlement saga. Build a village. Name your kin. Send out scouts. Found new halls across the strait. Weather raids. Write a chronicle that lasts.</p>\r\n<h2>Features</h2>\r\n<ol><li>160\u00d7160 procedural world with three map types: Viking Origin, Pangea, Archipelago</li><li>Multi-village economy &mdash; each outpost has its own working population, stockpile, and workplaces</li><li>Drakkar warships &mdash; combat-rated longships that can intercept raiders before they touch shore</li><li>Real seasons, real winters &mdash; kin freeze, animals migrate, the long night comes</li><li>The Winter Solstice scene &mdash; every year, on midwinter, the world holds its breath</li><li>A growing saga &mdash; every important moment is chronicled in your settlement&#x27;s permanent record</li><li>Founders remembered &mdash; the eight kin who first walked your shore are named in the saga across decades</li><li>Lives that matter &mdash; when a notable kin dies, the world pauses to honor them</li></ol>\r\n<h2>Controls</h2>\r\n<ol><li>Drag to pan the camera</li><li>Mouse wheel to zoom</li><li>Space to pause</li><li>Number keys 1/2/4/8 to set game speed</li><li>Click a kin to select; click an empty tile to assign work</li></ol>\r\n<h2>A game of slow Viking time</h2>\r\n<p><strong>This is not a fast game. It is a game about kin you remember, winters you survive, and a saga you keep. Play one in-game year, or twenty.</strong></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" aria-hidden width=\"12\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_6064000\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\">HTML5</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" class=\"aggregate_rating\" data-tooltip=\"5.00 average rating from 1 total ratings\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\" tabindex=\"0\"><div itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"star_value\" content=