ss=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p>weird maps frozen, everything else seems to be working tho. year 1 day 8</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fapd013.itch.io%2Fnorthbound\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\" data-register_action=\"community_reply\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"community_post_replies top_level_replies\"><div class=\"community_post is_reply has_vote_column\" id=\"post-16273018\" data-post=\"{&quot;user_id&quot;:17747080,&quot;id&quot;:16273018}\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a title=\"Vote up\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fapd013.itch.io%2Fnorthbound\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\"><svg height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" aria-hidden width=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a title=\"Vote down\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fapd013.itch.io%2Fnorthbound\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\"><svg height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" aria-hidden width=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/apd013\"><div style=\"background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4ODc1NjI2LnBuZw==/25x25%23/vzyNdv.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/apd013\">APD Games</a></span><span title=\"2026-06-11 17:57:13\" class=\"post_date\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/16273018\">83 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p>Thanks for the detailed report &mdash; you caught two real bugs and surfaced a third.</p>\r\n<p>The freeze was a missing role definition (fisher was in the game but not in</p>\r\n<p>the daily production table &mdash; it would crash the day-tick the first time a&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>fisher started working, which fits your &quot;Year 1 Day 8&quot; timing). The&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>ReferenceError every 30 seconds was the auto-save trying to look up a&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>variable that wasn&#x27;t in scope.</p>\r\n<p>Bigger fix: the game loop now catches errors so a single bad tick won&#x27;t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>freeze the whole game ever again &mdash; it logs the error and keeps running.</p>\r\n<p>All three fixed in 5.39, just pushed. Hard-refresh and your save should&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>load right where you left off. Sorry you had to be the first one to hit&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>this &mdash; let me know if you find anything else.</p>\r\n<p>&mdash; Adrian</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fapd013.itch.io%2Fnorthbound\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\" data-register_action=\"community_reply\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div></div><script id=\"vote_counts_tpl\" type=\"text/template\"><% if (up_score > 0) { %><span class=\"upvotes\">(+{{up_score}})</span><% } %><% if (down_score > 0) { %><span class=\"downvotes\">(-{{down_score}})</span><% } %></script></div></div></div></div><div class=\"right_col column\"><div class=\"video_embed\"></div><div class=\"screenshot_list\"><a data-image_lightbox=\"true\" href=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDY0MjQxMC8yNzgxMjA5Ni5wbmc=/original/3n3v0h.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"screenshot\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDY0MjQxMC8yNzgxMjA5Ni5wbmc=/347x500/dLmwKl.png\" data-screenshot_id=\"27812096\" srcset=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDY0MjQxMC8yNzgxMjA5Ni5wbmc=/347x500/dLmwKl.png 1x, https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDY0MjQxMC8yNzgxMjA5Ni5wbmc=/794x1000/L5d8iU.png 2x\"/></a><a data-image_lightbox=\"tru